vFM Player - PSG MIDI banks

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks/PSG

Copy psg.bnk / psg.bnk.gz. Used by the PSG profile and the PSG section of midi.ini.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks/PSG

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
